{'symbol': 'EQIX', 'date': '2022-12-19 08:01:00', 'title': 'MEDIA ALERT: EQUINIX TO SPEAK AT UPCOMING CITI COMMUNICATIONS, MEDIA & ENTERTAINMENT CONFERENCE', 'text': "REDWOOD CITY, CALIF. , DEC. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EQUINIX, INC. (NASDAQ: EQIX), THE WORLD'S DIGITAL INFRASTRUCTURE COMPANY™, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CHARLES MEYERS, PRESIDENT AND CEO, WILL PRESENT AT THE CITI COMMUNICATIONS, MEDIA & ENTERTAINMENT CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, JANUARY 4, 2023, AT 3:30 P.M."}